    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement in gender and number",
     "texto": [
      "The relative pronoun always agrees with the noun it refers to: **Der Mann, der hier arbeitet**; **Die Frau, die hier wohnt**; **Das Kind, das dort spielt**; **Die Nachbarn, die uns helfen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rule of the verb at the end and commas",
     "texto": [
      "Every relative clause in German is marked off by commas and sends the conjugated verb to the very last position: **Das ist die Kollegin, die heute Geburtstag hat**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
